  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Wan clan and Heavenly Court envoys visit Xiao clan headquarters, he states that Fang clan has fallen into the demonic path and that Xiao clan is willing to help Wan clan recover lost territory. After discussion, Wan clan cedes resource points and Xiao clan dispatches Xiao Ye Hu with several other experts.",
      "chapters": [
        2253
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_wan_clan",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "fac_xiao_clan_western_desert",
        "fac_fang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang clan immortals name him Xiao clan ‘s strongest support in the expedition. He had a fortuitous encounter when young, obtained a Gu Immortal true inheritance and a damaged Immortal Gu House, cultivated to Gu Immortal with Xiao clan ‘s help to repair the house, and changed his name to Xiao Ye Hu afterwards. Rumors call his dark path Immortal Gu House Chamber Pot extremely strange and vicious: though pocket-sized, it can forcefully absorb Gu Immortals, and a night trapped inside leaves them as a pile of piss and stool.",
      "chapters": [
        2255
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "chamber-pot-and-alliance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_chamber_pot"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He visits Wan clan to renegotiate as the situation changes, leaves contentedly once Xiao clan ‘s benefits are preserved, and returns again when muddy beach and perfume flying island are gone, pressing to change the contract rather than risk an immediate attack on Fang clan.",
      "chapters": [
        2256
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "chamber-pot-and-alliance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the large battle he moves Chamber Pot to block Fang Gong’s punch, but the punch destroys Chamber Pot, sinks his chest, and leaves him on the verge of death as blood and organs pour from his mouth.",
      "chapters": [
        2260
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battle-with-fang-gong",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_gong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Afterward he enters Dong Xi blessed land to plunder battle spoils, and with a cold and malevolent expression tells Fang clansmen they are his captives, then goes to Wan Gu Chou as Xiao clan ‘s representative to demand answers when the plunder fails to cover his losses. Forced to state a position on allying with Heavenly Court against the demonic path, he claims personal unwillingness to associate with the demonic path but refuses to represent Xiao clan without asking the first supreme elder.",
      "chapters": [
        2261
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battle-with-fang-gong",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wan_gu_chou"
      ]
    }
  ],
